      "type": "card",
      "text": "[H] My guess, not a measured fact: because the queen has so many lines, a beginner's queen mistakes are more often a forgotten diagonal than a forgotten rule. If so, it may help to vary the order in which you check her lines. Notice in the next round which of her lines you looked at last."
    },
